1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,767
And then a winter night, a sound. A
drip. A leak in the roof, right over
the bed.

2
00:00:05,467 --> 00:00:12,133
I told myself I'd fix it in spring.
Spring came. Then it rained for nine
days. Eleven buckets. Eleven.

3
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:18,800
Rule ten. Fix it before it breaks.
Small problems are free. Big problems
cost everything.

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:25,600
So you start a list. Every Sunday, you
walk the building. A loose tile. A
rusty hinge. A cracked pipe.

5
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,033
Deal with it.
